{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Embark on an Epic Journey Through Time!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Strategy and Precision</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275880/extras/Rewind.gif?t=1744031024\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every decision matters. Plan ahead, think carefully, and coordinate your actions to outsmart the traps of time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Knowledge is Your Greatest Ally</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275880/extras/code.gif?t=1744031024\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you progress through the time loops, gather insights to unravel mysteries and solve the enigma surrounding you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Master the Tools at Your Disposal</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275880/extras/bluekey.gif?t=1744031024\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use the items around you wisely. Clever utilization is the key to overcoming the challenges that lie ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A Puzzle for Sharp Minds</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275880/extras/bench.gif?t=1744031024\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Put your intelligence to the test by solving intricate puzzles and crafting ingenious strategies to succeed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Face the Dark Mage</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275880/extras/Morthas.gif?t=1744031024\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thwart h